{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791120300, "covers_from": "2026-10-04T13:25:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-04T13:26:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791120360, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-04T13:25:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14213, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望台北樹民可以開開心心的生活", "display_name": "大安代表 No.14,213", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T13:25:05+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41867, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市的停車位好少，不管是市區或住宅區都很難找停車位，請問未來市長是否有解決辦法呢？", "display_name": "士林代表 No.41,867", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T13:25:19+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11164, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "台北市中長期電線應該規劃地下化 及墳墓要遷移 對市容環境有幫助", "display_name": "文山代表 No.11,164", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T13:25:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50883, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "文化", "content": "我希望文化保存是可以跟城市發展共存，現在文化保存的人被拉黑當作城市發展的障礙，很心酸", "display_name": "大同代表 cwlan", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T13:25:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29064, "sprite_key": "turtle_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "食安", "content": "營養午餐吃得差就算了，開學沒幾天就傳出食物中毒，小孩只要能平安回家就好，已經是台北人最後的溫柔了嗎？", "display_name": "大同代表 No.29,064", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 41867, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.41,867", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 11164, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.11,164", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true